WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.184
The Options button opens the settings panel.

2
00:00:04.684 --> 00:00:10.002
Sliders set threads, connections per host, timeout and retries.

3
00:00:14.184 --> 00:00:20.270
Checkboxes control what is checked: external links, resources, mailto, robots.txt, SSRF protection.

4
00:00:24.176 --> 00:00:28.390
Tick “Check # anchors” and run the scan again.

5
00:00:35.638 --> 00:00:39.708
Now missing anchors show up as errors too.

